# Build context is the repo root (see the Dockerfile COPY paths).

# The web image builds its own dependencies; copying host ones in would shadow
# the lockfile-resolved tree with whatever the developer happened to have.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/

# Python/JS tooling caches that occasionally live in the tree.
**/.venv*/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/__pycache__/

.git/
infra/github-runner/*.tar.gz
data/
